      "reasoning": "Explicit polyoxyethylene sorbitan mono-oleate identifies polysorbate80, unlike unethoxylated sorbitan monooleate in #761. CHEBI53426 itself combines a variable polymer formula with representative fixed structures. The added qualification prevents those annotations becoming a claim of a measured single commercial molecule.",
